---
// Biografia.astro - Dedicated biography section for Piedad Morales (El Hada Rebelde)
// Based on the Stitch Design System "Tierra de Palabras"
import { asset } from "../utils/paths";
---

<section
  id="biografia"
  class="w-full py-16 sm:py-24 bg-surface-container-low relative overflow-hidden border-t border-b border-outline-variant/40"
>
  <!-- Running Stitch Decoration at Top and Bottom -->
  <div class="stitch-line absolute top-0 left-0 right-0 opacity-40"></div>
  <div class="stitch-line absolute bottom-0 left-0 right-0 opacity-40"></div>

  <!-- Ambient Organic Watermark Background -->
  <div
    class="absolute -top-24 -right-24 w-96 h-96 rounded-full bg-secondary-container/20 blur-3xl pointer-events-none"
  >
  </div>
  <div
    class="absolute -bottom-24 -left-24 w-96 h-96 rounded-full bg-tertiary-container/15 blur-3xl pointer-events-none"
  >
  </div>

  <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-6 sm:px-8 relative z-10">
    <!-- Section Header with Editorial Voice -->
    <div class="max-w-3xl mb-14 sm:mb-20">
      <div
        class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 bg-tertiary-fixed text-on-tertiary-fixed px-3.5 py-1 rounded-full text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-wider mb-4 border border-tertiary/20 shadow-xs"
      >
        <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-sm">history_edu</span>
        <span>Capítulo Biográfico • Archivo Vivo</span>
      </div>

      <h2
        class="font-display text-3xl sm:text-5xl lg:text-6xl font-bold text-terracotta tracking-tight leading-[1.15]"
      >
        La Cigarra Rebelde: <br class="hidden sm:inline" />
        <span class="italic text-ochre font-serif">Trazos de una Vida</span>
      </h2>

      <!-- Monospace Poetic Inscription -->
      <div
        class="mt-6 font-poetry text-sm sm:text-base text-charcoal bg-paper-grain p-4 sm:p-5 rounded-lg border-l-4 border-terracotta paper-shadow relative"
      >
        <p class="italic">
          «Diosa aromada de almizcle, María madre de sí misma...»
        </p>
        <span
          class="block text-right text-xs font-sans font-semibold text-on-surface-variant uppercase tracking-widest mt-2"
        >
          — Piedad Morales, <cite class="normal-case">Lluvia en la Memoria</cite
          >
        </span>
      </div>

      <p
        class="font-body text-base sm:text-lg text-on-surface-variant mt-6 leading-relaxed"
      >
        Nacida en 1956 en <strong class="text-charcoal font-semibold"
          >Puerto Berrío</strong
        >, a orillas del majestuoso Río Magdalena, Piedad Morales convirtió su
        existencia en un zurcido constante entre la poesía íntima, la salud
        comunitaria y el pacifismo feminista en Antioquia.
      </p>
    </div>

    <!-- Main Content Layout: Story + Archival Imagery -->
    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-12 gap-10 lg:gap-12 items-start">
      <!-- Left Column (lg:col-span-7): Chronological Journey / Timeline -->
      <div class="lg:col-span-7 space-y-8">
        <div
          class="flex items-center justify-between pb-2 border-b border-outline-variant/60"
        >
          <h3
            class="font-display text-2xl font-bold text-terracotta flex items-center gap-2"
          >
            <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-ochre">timeline</span>
            <span>Hitos de Resistencia y Ternura</span>
          </h3>
          <span
            class="text-xs font-mono font-bold text-ochre bg-secondary-fixed/60 px-2.5 py-1 rounded-md"
          >
            1956 — 2012
          </span>
        </div>

        <!-- Vertical Timeline Tree -->
        <div
          class="relative pl-6 sm:pl-8 space-y-10 before:absolute before:inset-y-2 before:left-2.5 sm:before:left-3.5 before:w-0.5 before:bg-gradient-to-b before:from-terracotta before:via-ochre before:to-feminist-purple"
        >
          <!-- Milestone 1: 1956 -->
          <div class="relative group">
            <!-- Timeline Pin Dot -->
            <div
              class="absolute -left-6 sm:-left-8 top-1.5 w-6 h-6 rounded-full bg-surface-container-lowest border-2 border-terracotta flex items-center justify-center shadow-xs group-hover:scale-125 group-hover:bg-terracotta transition-all duration-300"
            >
              <span
                class="w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-terracotta group-hover:bg-on-primary"
              ></span>
            </div>

            <div
              class="bg-surface-container-lowest p-6 rounded-xl border border-outline-variant/50 paper-shadow hover:-translate-y-0.5 transition-all"
            >
              <div
                class="flex flex-wrap items-center justify-between gap-2 mb-2"
              >
                <span class="font-display text-xl font-bold text-terracotta"
                  >1956</span
                >
                <span
                  class="text-[11px] font-bold uppercase tracking-wider text-ochre bg-secondary-fixed/50 px-2.5 py-0.5 rounded-full"
                >
                  Raíces Ribereñas
                </span>
              </div>
              <h4 class="font-display text-lg font-bold text-charcoal mb-1.5">
                Cuna a Orillas del Río Magdalena
              </h4>
              <p
                class="font-body text-sm text-on-surface-variant leading-relaxed"
              >
                Nace en Puerto Berrío. Crece escuchando el fluir del río y el
                trajín de los pescadores y trenes. Ese paisaje de agua indómita,
                calor y dolor ribereño marcaría para siempre su estética poética
                y su honda empatía por las comunidades más vulnerables.
              </p>
            </div>
          </div>

          <!-- Milestone 2: Años 80 -->
          <div class="relative group">
            <div
              class="absolute -left-6 sm:-left-8 top-1.5 w-6 h-6 rounded-full bg-surface-container-lowest border-2 border-ochre flex items-center justify-center shadow-xs group-hover:scale-125 group-hover:bg-ochre transition-all duration-300"
            >
              <span
                class="w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-ochre group-hover:bg-on-primary"
              ></span>
            </div>

            <div
              class="bg-surface-container-lowest p-6 rounded-xl border border-outline-variant/50 paper-shadow hover:-translate-y-0.5 transition-all"
            >
              <div
                class="flex flex-wrap items-center justify-between gap-2 mb-2"
              >
                <span class="font-display text-xl font-bold text-ochre"
                  >Años 80</span
                >
                <span
                  class="text-[11px] font-bold uppercase tracking-wider text-terracotta bg-primary-fixed px-2.5 py-0.5 rounded-full"
                >
                  Vocación y Cuidado
                </span>
              </div>
              <h4 class="font-display text-lg font-bold text-charcoal mb-1.5">
                Enfermería Psiquiátrica y la Palabra como Medicina
              </h4>
              <p
                class="font-body text-sm text-on-surface-variant leading-relaxed"
              >
                Se traslada a Medellín y se forma en enfermería en salud mental.
                En los pabellones hospitalarios y asilos, comprende que la
                locura y el sufrimiento a menudo son heridas del abandono
                social. Allí la escucha compasiva y la poesía nacen como bálsamo
                curativo.
              </p>
            </div>
          </div>

          <!-- Milestone 3: Años 90 -->
          <div class="relative group">
            <div
              class="absolute -left-6 sm:-left-8 top-1.5 w-6 h-6 rounded-full bg-surface-container-lowest border-2 border-feminist-purple flex items-center justify-center shadow-xs group-hover:scale-125 group-hover:bg-feminist-purple transition-all duration-300"
            >
              <span
                class="w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-feminist-purple group-hover:bg-on-primary"
              ></span>
            </div>

            <div
              class="bg-surface-container-lowest p-6 rounded-xl border border-outline-variant/50 paper-shadow hover:-translate-y-0.5 transition-all"
            >
              <div
                class="flex flex-wrap items-center justify-between gap-2 mb-2"
              >
                <span
                  class="font-display text-xl font-bold text-feminist-purple"
                  >Años 90</span
                >
                <span
                  class="text-[11px] font-bold uppercase tracking-wider text-feminist-purple bg-tertiary-fixed px-2.5 py-0.5 rounded-full"
                >
                  Despertar Político
                </span>
              </div>
              <h4 class="font-display text-lg font-bold text-charcoal mb-1.5">
                Rutas de Paz y Colectivos Feministas
              </h4>
              <p
                class="font-body text-sm text-on-surface-variant leading-relaxed"
              >
                En una Medellín golpeada por el narcotráfico y la guerra urbana,
                Piedad se integra activamente a organizaciones pioneras como la <strong
                  class="text-charcoal font-semibold"
                  >Corporación Vamos Mujer</strong
                >, la <strong class="text-charcoal font-semibold"
                  >Ruta Pacífica de las Mujeres</strong
                > y <strong class="text-charcoal font-semibold"
                  >Mujeres de Negro</strong
                >, proclamando la desmilitarización de la vida y el cuerpo.
              </p>
            </div>
          </div>

          <!-- Milestone 4: 2000s -->
          <div class="relative group">
            <div
              class="absolute -left-6 sm:-left-8 top-1.5 w-6 h-6 rounded-full bg-surface-container-lowest border-2 border-ochre flex items-center justify-center shadow-xs group-hover:scale-125 group-hover:bg-ochre transition-all duration-300"
            >
              <span
                class="w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-ochre group-hover:bg-on-primary"
              ></span>
            </div>

            <div
              class="bg-surface-container-lowest p-6 rounded-xl border border-outline-variant/50 paper-shadow hover:-translate-y-0.5 transition-all"
            >
              <div
                class="flex flex-wrap items-center justify-between gap-2 mb-2"
              >
                <span class="font-display text-xl font-bold text-ochre"
                  >2000 — 2010</span
                >
                <span
                  class="text-[11px] font-bold uppercase tracking-wider text-secondary bg-secondary-fixed/50 px-2.5 py-0.5 rounded-full"
                >
                  Arte Comunitario
                </span>
              </div>
              <h4 class="font-display text-lg font-bold text-charcoal mb-1.5">
                Carnavalenguas: La Risa como Trinchera
              </h4>
              <p
                class="font-body text-sm text-on-surface-variant leading-relaxed"
              >
                Adopta el personaje entrañable de <strong
                  class="text-charcoal font-semibold"
                  >«La Cigarra Rebelde»</strong
                >: cabellera tejida con hebras de lana de colores, rostro
                pintado de mariposa y vestidos artesanales. Funda comparsas
                populares donde el juego, los títeres y el teatro callejero
                devuelven la esperanza a niñas, niños y madres comunitarias.
              </p>
            </div>
          </div>

          <!-- Milestone 5: 2012 y Memoria -->
          <div class="relative group">
            <div
              class="absolute -left-6 sm:-left-8 top-1.5 w-6 h-6 rounded-full bg-surface-container-lowest border-2 border-terracotta flex items-center justify-center shadow-xs group-hover:scale-125 group-hover:bg-terracotta transition-all duration-300"
            >
              <span
                class="w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-terracotta group-hover:bg-on-primary"
              ></span>
            </div>

            <div
              class="bg-surface-container-lowest p-6 rounded-xl border border-outline-variant/50 paper-shadow hover:-translate-y-0.5 transition-all"
            >
              <div
                class="flex flex-wrap items-center justify-between gap-2 mb-2"
              >
                <span class="font-display text-xl font-bold text-terracotta"
                  >2012</span
                >
                <span
                  class="text-[11px] font-bold uppercase tracking-wider text-terracotta bg-primary-fixed px-2.5 py-0.5 rounded-full"
                >
                  Siembra y Semilla
                </span>
              </div>
              <h4 class="font-display text-lg font-bold text-charcoal mb-1.5">
                Paso a la Eternidad en la Memoria Colectiva
              </h4>
              <p
                class="font-body text-sm text-on-surface-variant leading-relaxed"
              >
                Su siembra física en Medellín dejó un legado imperecedero. Sus
                poemas, cantos y muñecas de trapo permanecen como testimonios
                vivos de que la ternura no es debilidad, sino la forma más
                valiente de la dignidad humana.
              </p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Right Column (lg:col-span-5): Archival Visual Cards & Authentic Photographs -->
      <div class="lg:col-span-5 space-y-8">
        <!-- Photo 1: Piedad Morales with Rainbow Yarn Hair (PiedadMorales3.jpeg) -->
        <div class="relative group">
          <!-- Handcrafted cross-stitch detailing -->
          <div
            class="absolute -top-3 -right-3 z-20 flex items-center gap-1 text-ochre select-none pointer-events-none"
            aria-hidden="true"
          >
            <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-lg rotate-45"
              >close</span
            >
            <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-lg rotate-45"
              >close</span
            >
          </div>

          <div
            class="rag-doll-border bg-surface-container-highest p-3 paper-shadow transform -rotate-1 group-hover:rotate-0 transition-transform duration-500 bg-paper-grain"
          >
            <div
              class="relative overflow-hidden rounded-lg aspect-[4/4.5] bg-surface-container"
            >
              <img
                src={asset("/images/PiedadMorales3.jpeg")}
                alt="Retrato auténtico de Piedad Morales luciendo su icónica peluca de lanas multicolores y su mirada serena"
                class="w-full h-full object-cover object-top group-hover:scale-105 transition-transform duration-700"
                loading="lazy"
              />
              <div
                class="absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-t from-charcoal/70 via-transparent to-transparent pointer-events-none"
              >
              </div>

              <!-- Caption Badge -->
              <div
                class="absolute bottom-3 left-3 right-3 bg-surface/95 backdrop-blur-xs p-3 rounded-md border border-outline-variant/60 shadow-sm"
              >
                <div class="flex items-center justify-between">
                  <div>
                    <p class="font-display font-bold text-terracotta text-sm">
                      Piedad Morales en Carnaval
                    </p>
                    <p class="font-body text-xs text-on-surface-variant">
                      Personificando a la Cigarra Rebelde con su corona de
                      hebras
                    </p>
                  </div>
                  <span
                    class="w-8 h-8 rounded-full bg-ochre/10 flex items-center justify-center text-ochre"
                  >
                    <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-base"
                      >palette</span
                    >
                  </span>
                </div>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Photo 2: Community Women & Sorority (PiedadMorales4.jpeg) -->
        <div class="relative group">
          <div
            class="rag-doll-border-alt bg-surface-container-highest p-3 paper-shadow transform rotate-1 group-hover:rotate-0 transition-transform duration-500 bg-paper-grain"
          >
            <div
              class="relative overflow-hidden rounded-lg aspect-[4/3] bg-surface-container"
            >
              <img
                src={asset("/images/PiedadMorales4.jpeg")}
                alt="Fotografía comunitaria de mujeres activistas y Piedad compartiendo sonrisas, rostros pintados y sororidad en Medellín"
                class="w-full h-full object-cover group-hover:scale-105 transition-transform duration-700"
                loading="lazy"
              />
              <div
                class="absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-t from-charcoal/65 via-transparent to-transparent pointer-events-none"
              >
              </div>

              <!-- Caption Badge -->
              <div
                class="absolute bottom-3 left-3 right-3 bg-surface/95 backdrop-blur-xs p-3 rounded-md border border-outline-variant/60 shadow-sm"
              >
                <div class="flex items-center justify-between">
                  <div>
                    <p
                      class="font-display font-bold text-feminist-purple text-sm"
                    >
                      Círculo de Mujeres y Alegría
                    </p>
                    <p class="font-body text-xs text-on-surface-variant">
                      Talleres populares y comparsas por la paz
                    </p>
                  </div>
                  <span
                    class="w-8 h-8 rounded-full bg-feminist-purple/10 flex items-center justify-center text-feminist-purple"
                  >
                    <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-base"
                      >diversity_1</span
                    >
                  </span>
                </div>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Handwritten Verse Scrapbook Card: "Regalo" -->
        <div
          class="bg-surface-container-lowest p-6 rounded-xl border border-outline-variant/60 paper-shadow colouring-fill relative overflow-hidden"
        >
          <div class="absolute top-3 right-3 text-terracotta/20">
            <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-5xl">auto_stories</span>
          </div>

          <span
            class="text-[11px] font-mono font-bold uppercase tracking-widest text-terracotta block mb-2"
          >
            Fragmento del Archivo • «Regalo»
          </span>

          <div
            class="font-poetry text-charcoal text-sm leading-relaxed bg-paper-grain p-4 rounded-md border border-outline-variant/40 mb-4 shadow-inner"
          >
            <p class="whitespace-pre-line italic">
              «Quisiera dibujar un verso pequeñito: Regalarte fragancia de
              ramas, Colores secretos de arco iris, sabores de frutas lunares...
              Sólo tengo esta estrella que muere en mí.»
            </p>
          </div>

          <div
            class="flex items-center justify-between pt-2 border-t border-outline-variant/30 text-xs"
          >
            <span class="font-medium text-on-surface-variant"
              >Manuscrito de Piedad</span
            >
            <span
              class="font-bold text-terracotta inline-flex items-center gap-1"
            >
              <span>Palabra descalza</span>
              <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-sm">feather</span>
            </span>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Testimonial Quote Card -->
        <div
          class="bg-tertiary-fixed/60 text-on-tertiary-fixed p-6 rounded-xl border border-feminist-purple/20 paper-shadow relative"
        >
          <span
            class="material-symbols-outlined text-feminist-purple/30 text-5xl absolute -top-2 -left-1 select-none pointer-events-none"
          >
            format_quote
          </span>
          <p
            class="font-serif italic text-sm sm:text-base text-charcoal leading-relaxed relative z-10 pl-6 mb-4"
          >
            "Piedad era un huracán de ternura. Sus palabras no solo consolaban
            el dolor de la violencia; despertaban el coraje y la dignidad de
            cada mujer que la escuchaba."
          </p>
          <div class="flex items-center gap-3 pl-6">
            <div
              class="w-9 h-9 rounded-full bg-feminist-purple text-on-primary flex items-center justify-center font-bold text-xs"
            >
              SM
            </div>
            <div>
              <p class="font-display font-bold text-xs text-charcoal">
                Silvia María García Ángel
              </p>
              <p class="text-[11px] text-on-surface-variant font-medium">
                Compañera de ruta y memoria viva
              </p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
